sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant Recon as Static Recon Scenario<br/>(implemented)
    participant Target as Target Network
    participant Agent as AI Agent (LLM)
    participant RAG as RAG System
    participant KB as Knowledge Base<br/>(CVE, hardening, MITRE ATTACK)

    Note over Recon,KB: Future work: hybrid pipeline<br/>engineered breadth + RAG grounding + AI depth

    Operator->>Recon: run reconnaissance
    activate Recon

    Note over Recon,Target: 1. Deterministic breadth
    Recon->>Target: exhaustive scan<br/>(arp-scan, nmap -sV, NSE)
    Target-->>Recon: hosts, services, versions, findings
    Recon-->>Agent: ReconnaissanceScenarioResult<br/>(reproducible, structured)
    deactivate Recon

    activate Agent
    Note over Agent,KB: 2. Ground the findings (RAG)
    loop per finding
        Agent->>RAG: retrieve context for service / version
        activate RAG
        RAG->>KB: similarity search
        KB-->>RAG: relevant documents
        RAG-->>Agent: grounded knowledge
        deactivate RAG
    end

    Note over Agent: 3. AI depth<br/>semantic assessment + attack-chain reasoning<br/>(grounded means fewer hallucinations)
    Agent-->>Operator: prioritized report<br/>(findings, severity, next steps)
    deactivate Agent
